          xLabel="SOC %"
          yLabel="电压 (V)"
          data={[
            { x: 0, y: 11.5, label: "0%" },
            { x: 10, y: 11.64, label: "10%" },
            { x: 20, y: 11.76, label: "20%" },
            { x: 30, y: 11.88, label: "30%" },
            { x: 40, y: 12.0, label: "40%" },
            { x: 50, y: 12.12, label: "50%" },
            { x: 60, y: 12.24, label: "60%" },
            { x: 70, y: 12.34, label: "70%" },
            { x: 80, y: 12.46, label: "80%" },
            { x: 90, y: 12.58, label: "90%" },
            { x: 100, y: 12.7, label: "100%" },
          ]}
          yMin={11.0}
          yMax={13.2}
          caption="富液式铅酸数值以 25°C 为准。实际电压因制造商、老化、温度和测量条件而异。"
        />

        <h2 class="text-title-lg text-primary uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          富液式铅酸电压图表
        </h2>
        <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">
          富液式铅酸电池的静置电压与 SOC 之间有较明确的对应关系。与磷酸铁锂不同，电压在整个 SOC 范围内下降相对线性，因此电压是实用的 SOC 指标——前提是电池已经静置，并计入了温度。
        </p>
        <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline overflow-hidden">
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left text-body-sm min-w-[640px]">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-hairline bg-surface-card">
                  <th class="p-4 text-label-uppercase text-primary text-xs tracking-wider">SOC %</th>
                  <th class="p-4 text-label-uppercase text-primary text-xs tracking-wider">12V 电池组</th>
                  <th class="p-4 text-label-uppercase text-primary text-xs tracking-wider">24V 电池组</th>
                  <th class="p-4 text-label-uppercase text-primary text-xs tracking-wider">48V 电池组</th>
                  <th class="p-4 text-label-uppercase text-primary text-xs tracking-wider">说明</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-hairline">
